class QgsEsriArcadeStatement : QgsEsriArcadeNode
{
%Docstring(signature="appended")
Base class for statement nodes in an Esri Arcade script.

Subclasses represent standalone statements, such as a variable
declaration, if statement, for loop, etc.

.. versionadded:: 4.4
%End

%TypeHeaderCode
#include "qgsesriarcadescript.h"
%End
  public:
    ~QgsEsriArcadeStatement();
};

class QgsEsriArcadeExpression : QgsEsriArcadeNode
{
%Docstring(signature="appended")
Base class for expression nodes in an Esri Arcade script.

Subclasses represent expressions, which are a portion of a statement
representing an expression.

For example ``1+2``, ``Upper('A string')``, or literals like ``255`` or
``'a string'``.

.. versionadded:: 4.4
%End

%TypeHeaderCode
#include "qgsesriarcadescript.h"
%End
  public:
    ~QgsEsriArcadeExpression();
};

